

-> What is Garbage Collection?

    Automatic process of:
        Finding unused objects
        Freeing heap memory

-> Minor GC vs Major GC
    | Minor GC  | Major GC |
    | --------- | -------- |
    | Young Gen | Old Gen  |
    | Fast      | Slow     |
    | Frequent  | Rare     |

Stop-The-World Event
    All application threads pause
    GC runs
    After GC → threads resume

📌 This is why heavy GC affects performance.